{"abstract":"FMCSA announces its decision to deny the applications from three individuals treated with an ICD who requested an exemption from the Federal Motor Carrier Safety Regulations (FMCSRs) prohibiting operation of a commercial motor vehicle (CMV) in interstate commerce by persons with a current clinical diagnosis of myocardial infarction, angina pectoris, coronary insufficiency, thrombosis, or any other cardiovascular disease of a variety known to be accompanied by syncope (transient loss of consciousness), dyspnea (shortness of breath), collapse, or congestive heart failure.","action":"Notice of denials.","agencies":[{"id":492,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/492","name":"Transportation Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF TRANSPORTATION","slug":"transportation-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/transportation-department"},{"id":181,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/181","name":"Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration","parent_id":492,"raw_name":"Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration","slug":"federal-motor-carrier-safety-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/federal-motor-carrier-safety-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06863.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19174","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/FMCSA-2021-0085-0011","comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":null,"disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. FMCSA-2021-0085"],"dockets":[{"agency_name":null,"documents":[{"allow_late_comments":true,"comment_count":0,"comment_end_date":null,"comment_start_date":"2022-04-01","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/FMCSA-2021-0085-0011","id":"FMCSA-2021-0085-0011","regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false,"updated_at":"2024-11-06T20:55:42.830-05:00"}],"id":"FMCSA-2021-0085","supp